[I] A command-line, AlbumWrap and mp3wrap file exctractor

[T] mp3splt is a command line utility to split mp3 and ogg vorbis files at
[T] given time points or detected silence without decoding, and to extract
[T] tracks from AlbumWrap and mp3wrap files. It is based on libmp3splt.

[U] https://mp3splt.sourceforge.net/

[A] Mp3splt Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

